{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111300","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111300","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1311130001:1":{"text":"Please forgive my attendants. They are not accustomed to guests and tend to be excessively vigilant regarding outsiders.","source_cn":"请原谅侍者们的失礼。它们很少见外客，对外界过于警惕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDD3427D62F0ACF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311130002:1":{"text":"Your thoughtful gift is truly appreciated and far too precious for me to decline...","source_cn":"多谢你们的礼物，它如此贵重……我无法拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F29207163976E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311130003:1":{"text":"I sense you have a significant matter to discuss with me.","source_cn":"我想，你们一定有必须见我的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8978DEE295CD5358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1311130003":{"text":"I sense you have a significant matter to discuss with me.","source_cn":"我想，你们一定有必须见我的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8978DEE295CD5358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311130004:1":{"text":"You're even younger than Chippy imagined...","source_cn":"你比我想象的还要年轻……你、你这么早就成为了亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FC7FDEB8433C566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311130005:1":{"text":"I was underage when I became a Graveborn.","source_cn":"是的，成为亡灵的时候我尚未成年。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70D594DABFE0084F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311130009:1":{"text":"Pray tell, what brings you to this secluded manor to seek help from a Graveborn?","source_cn":"那么，各位有什么事，需要来到这座偏僻的庄园，找我这样一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2993C50BB41B005A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311130010:1":{"text":"We wish to confirm the accuracy of your earlier claim that Princess Yolena suffered from a serious illness and has passed away.","source_cn":"是关于公国的亚莲娜公主。你曾和我说过，公主身患重病，已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53F69365BB727646","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1311130011:1":{"text":"Oh, Yolena, that lovely little girl—lovely, yet so pathetic.","source_cn":"亚莲娜啊……可爱的小姑娘，可爱，但却可悲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD059F09321AA320F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311130012:1":{"text":"Correct. She fell victim to a hereditary condition that proved incurable.","source_cn":"没错，她已经死了，死于一种家族遗传的、无法治愈的疾病。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37DB53F90FF06813","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1311130013:2":{"text":"What?! S-she really is dead?!","source_cn":"什么？！她、她真的已经死了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55E0528DE8AEA221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1311130014:1":{"text":"When did she pass away?","source_cn":"……请问，她是什么时候去世的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE451403070A66D36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1311130015:1":{"text":"It was roughly a year ago. Unfortunately, the exact date escapes me.","source_cn":"大约在一年前，具体的日子我并不记得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AE82BE5F305C6A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1311130016:1":{"text":"Sigmund was in deep despair as though he had lost his soul. He pleaded with every god he could think of to save his daughter.","source_cn":"齐格蒙德——她的父亲——绝望得像是失去了灵魂，恳求所有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x871F39E4CEDF0B3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1311130017:1":{"text":"Yet, the gods did not hear his lament.","source_cn":"可是，神明听不见他的哭泣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1E38811F4A379C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1311130018:1":{"text":"With no other options, he sought my help, wishing for me to turn Yolena into a Graveborn. He was willing to do anything to preserve his daughter's life.","source_cn":"无奈之下，他来求我，希望我能将亚莲娜转化为亡灵。无论用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4927B24D0B11B73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1311130018":{"text":"With no other options, he sought my help, wishing for me to turn Yolena into a Graveborn. He was willing to do anything to preserve his daughter's life.","source_cn":"无奈之下，他来求我，希望我能将亚莲娜转化为亡灵。无论用什么方式，他都想要让自己女儿活着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4927B24D0B11B73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1311130019:1":{"text":"So the princess we met was a Graveborn? But she didn't look like one at all...","source_cn":"难道和我们一起玩的亚莲娜公主是亡灵？可是……她没有一点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47B1DF493A8A712","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1311130020:1":{"text":"No, I refused.","source_cn":"不，我拒绝了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC7A60B50BC7EF5BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"No, I refused.","female":"No, I refused.","variant_male_record_index":"141179","variant_female_record_index":"141180","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1311130022:2":{"text":"Why...?","source_cn":"拒绝了？！为什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F4FBB90678251F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1311130023:1":{"text":"Oh, you can't comprehend either? I guess the allure of \"being alive\" is a temptation few can truly resist.","source_cn":"啊……你们也不能理解吗？哈，看来“活着”是大多数人都无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B35A52BF7957DED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1311130024:1":{"text":"Come with me. Let me give you a tour of Everstill Manor.","source_cn":"随我来吧，我带你们参观一下永寂庄园。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADD6EB282FB5506F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1311130025:1":{"text":"Doesn't the duchy's descent into ruin resemble the decaying remains of this manor? How perfectly tragic...","source_cn":"走向末路的公国，与这座已经毁灭的宅邸残垣，是多么相称啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x321CFE66C89CCF1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1311130026:0":{"text":"Please wait for us, Lord Ludovic!","source_cn":"请等等我们，柳博米尔先生……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AA0C38C54301A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1311130027:1":{"text":"Let's follow him.","source_cn":"……走，跟上他吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EBC63BD562DC02C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"Did you say yes?","source_cn":"你答应了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA1B330AD13179C76","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Did you say yes?","female":"Did you say yes?","variant_male_record_index":"67702","variant_female_record_index":"67703","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1311130021:1":{"text":"I could sense his despair, but I had to say no.","source_cn":"是的。他很绝望，但我还是拒绝了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF8AF25A1A74D60FE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I could sense his despair, but I had to say no.","female":"I could sense his despair, but I had to say no.","variant_male_record_index":"141181","variant_female_record_index":"141182","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:1:2":{"text":"Did you say no?","source_cn":"你拒绝了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF1529BC3893E6B26","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Did you say no?","female":"Did you say no?","variant_male_record_index":"67704","variant_female_record_index":"67705","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"Pleased to meet you.","source_cn":"很高兴见到你","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x417DE8CAB0F76D86","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Pleased to meet you.","female":"Pleased to meet you.","variant_male_record_index":"67696","variant_female_record_index":"67697","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"I'm glad you like our gift...","source_cn":"还好礼物有用……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x732EFF65F9E6D4C0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm glad you like our gift...","female":"I'm glad you like our gift...","variant_male_record_index":"67698","variant_female_record_index":"67699","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1311130006:1":{"text":"As friends of Miss Valka, His Lordship would not deny your entry, even without a gift!","source_cn":"你们是瓦丽卡女士的朋友，就算没有礼物，高贵的子爵先生也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x430AFFF0231E848E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1311130007:1":{"text":"There's no need for such formality, Václav. Everstill Manor has traditionally kept its doors closed to those from outside.","source_cn":"不必如此，瓦茨拉夫。永寂庄园就是不欢迎外人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB213A45E02E83B52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1311130008:1":{"text":"Yet I find myself quite fond of the gift presented by these guests. They demonstrate good manners.","source_cn":"但是我确实很喜欢这几位客人的礼物。他们是知礼的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE26F7D339A6F0A8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:2:3":{"text":"We need your help.","source_cn":"我们有很重要的事","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD4FF0B1B7DC6EBB1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We need your help.","female":"We need your help.","variant_male_record_index":"67700","variant_female_record_index":"67701","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"Ludovic","source":"柳博米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"Valka","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:管家瓦茨拉夫":{"text":"Butler Václav","source":"管家瓦茨拉夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":35,"localized_text_count":34,"speaker_count":5}}